bin/
*.jsonl
*.jsonl.*
# The Wazuh rule fixtures are committed on purpose: deploy/wazuh/rules_test.go reads them,
# so without them `go test ./...` fails on a fresh clone, and wazuh-logtest has nothing to
# verify the rules against. The *.jsonl rule above exists to keep event sinks and spools
# out of the repository, and it silently swallowed these until CI was added.
!deploy/**/*.jsonl
fingerprint.key
*.key
!deploy/**/*.key
